### Config ###
	EventName        Internal label (not shown to players).
	DropZen          Zen amount dropped, 0 = none.
	ItemDropRate     Percent chance an item drops at all, out of 100.
	ItemDropCount    How many items to roll when it does drop.
	SetItemDropRate  Percent chance the item is a random Set item variant.
	ItemDropType     Drop behavior (ground drop vs direct-to-inventory).
	SendFirework     1 = show fireworks effect on drop.
	Coin1/2/3        WCoin/WCoinP/GoblinPoint flat bonus, granted
	                 every time this bag triggers. 0 = none.
	GensContribution Flat Gens contribution points bonus. 0 = none.

### Item ###
	Type/Index    Item code (GET_ITEM(Type,Index) - matches Item.xml).
	MinLevel/MaxLevel   Random item level range.
	Option1-3/NewOption Random option rolls.
	Time          Duration in seconds for a rental/temporary item, 0 = permanent.
	DropRate      Relative weight among this bag's <Item> rows.
	SocketOption      Forces exactly this many sockets (1-5), guaranteed.
	SocketOptionRate  Random socket count instead - index into
	                  ItemOptionRate.xml's <Option6> table.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
